---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import CallToAction from "../components/CallToAction.astro";
const lang = "fr";
---
<Layout title="Devenir partenaire — Pachatopia" description="Construisons ensemble quelque chose de plus grand" lang={lang}>
  <Header lang={lang} />
  <main>
    <section class="relative text-white py-24 md:py-32 bg-primary overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0"><img src="/pachatopia/images/farm-hero.jpg" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" /><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/85"></div></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-heading font-bold mb-6">Devenir partenaire</h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-white/90">Construisons ensemble quelque chose de plus grand</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="py-16 bg-white"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-4 text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
<p>Entreprises, fondations, écoles, chercheurs, collectivités, associations, artisans ou entrepreneurs peuvent devenir partenaires.</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-primary mt-10 mb-4">Pourquoi devenir partenaire ?</h2><p>Les plus grandes transformations grandissent lorsqu'une multitude de structures avancent dans une même direction.</p><div class="bg-primary text-white rounded-2xl p-10 my-12 text-center"><h3 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold mb-4">Devenir partenaire</h3><p class="mb-6">Construisons ensemble un avenir où le vivant retrouve toute sa place.</p><a href="/pachatopia/contacts/" class="button-primary-dark">Nous contacter</a></div>
    </div></section>
    <CallToAction lang={lang} />
  </main>
  <Footer lang={lang} />
</Layout>